---
source: tests/help_snapshot.rs
expression: "stdout_of(&[\"-e\", source, \"--help\"])"
---
Usage: rill <script> [options] <host> <command> [command options]

Arguments:
  <host>                 host to deploy to

Options:
  -v, --verbose          print every step [default: false]
  -p, --port <Int>       port to listen on [default: 8080]
      --config <Path>    override the config file [optional]
      --timeout <Duration> [default: 30s]
      --host <Str>       host to deploy to [required]
  -h, --help             show this help

Commands:
  start
          --workers <Int>  [default: 4]
  stop
          --force          [default: false]
